  "releaseNotes": "### Bug Fixes\n\nfix:Fix DateTimeToString formatting logic for Long/Short modes\n\n- Replaced manual yyyy/MM/dd formatting with culture‑based patterns\n- Long now uses culture.DateTimeFormat.LongDatePattern\n- Short now uses culture.DateTimeFormat.ShortDatePattern\n- Ensures correct PersianCalendar usage and full WPF‑consistent behavior\n- Removes duplicated formatting logic and fixes identical Long/Short output\n\nstyle(PersianCalendar): Calendar Theme Visual Improvements\n\nupdate:The below properties has been added to CalendarDayInfo\n\n- Id\n- Tag",
